WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.3 · Strategic Foundations
Stakeholder mapping

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Separate who benefits, who pays, who decides and who influences.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List everyone who affects, or is affected by, your work.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Rate each group’s interest and influence.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Decide how you will engage each priority group.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Trainees benefit but have little influence: monthly meeting with Diego. Office clients pay and decide on contracts: consulted every quarter.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a stakeholder map and a plan to include the overlooked.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
